# Audio I/O

- Implement `IAudioReader` with `ProbeAsync` + `ReadAsync` (single read pass for data)
- Builder extensions register **reader only**: `.UseFFMPEG()`, `.UseNAudio()`
- Writers used via `CreateWriter()` + `WriteToDirectoryAsync` / `WriteToFileAsync` extensions
- `IAudioWriter.WriteAsync` accepts `StemAudio`, not raw pipeline context
